      <h2>Locally &amp; Woman-Owned Since 1998</h2>
      <p>Since 1998, our locally and woman-owned business has been at the forefront of mobility solutions. With over 20 years under our belt, we've seen it all and fixed it all—from scooters to wheelchairs, if we sell it, we repair it.</p>
      <p>Our commitment to you doesn't end with a sale. We offer a 1-year warranty on our labor, plus manufacturer warranties, and we come to you — no need to worry about how you'll get your powered wheelchair or scooter to us for repairs. We offer free personalized consultations to ensure you get exactly what you need.</p>
